    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KNOCK 'EM OUT!</strong></h2>Lovingly smack your loved ones and stylishly throw them into various things! As Backyard Beans, you meet where it hurts and joyfully brawl through your circle of friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COOPERATIVE BRAWLING</strong></h2>True to the motto &quot;together against each other,&quot; you meet in the backyards of the Rocket Beans universe and briefly settle in this brawler who is right and why. Talking is silver, silence is gold. Hitting is Epic Legendary Mystic Platinum.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/a12893286005dd107999402a9bc253cf.webp?t=1724531654\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b77a1d339ec55c3d0214a258417ce123.poster.avif?t=1724531654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b77a1d339ec55c3d0214a258417ce123.webm?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b77a1d339ec55c3d0214a258417ce123.mp4?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/d3c20d2b62e9b89c12b9b2324d0ce66b.webp?t=1724531654\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/e3a805fd1260e39732a152728a15af24.poster.avif?t=1724531654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/e3a805fd1260e39732a152728a15af24.webm?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/e3a805fd1260e39732a152728a15af24.mp4?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/6d7819db5e1d4154a18f6487a71422fc.webp?t=1724531654\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/38fa8919dd48b040a604a9cc7482b02c.poster.avif?t=1724531654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/38fa8919dd48b040a604a9cc7482b02c.webm?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/38fa8919dd48b040a604a9cc7482b02c.mp4?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/7fdac50b1675cfebb561645e94714219.webp?t=1724531654\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/718a8837f7d90577cd22ed1d79e14770.poster.avif?t=1724531654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/718a8837f7d90577cd22ed1d79e14770.webm?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/718a8837f7d90577cd22ed1d79e14770.mp4?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/6985f71ae75d5d93d39b5c56636ff084.webp?t=1724531654\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b444ffa78d9b77c49db23a92069cf571.poster.avif?t=1724531654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b444ffa78d9b77c49db23a92069cf571.webm?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/b444ffa78d9b77c49db23a92069cf571.mp4?t=1724531654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALL OR NOTHING \u2013 NOT SO EASY ACCESS</strong></h2>Backyard Beans is in Early Access and hopefully shows you what the foundation for the game's further development could look like. We have our own wish and feature list, but we are very excited about your support and feedback. Of course, we would be happy about many sold versions \u2013 they would allow us to adapt the development time and financial basis more structured and better to everyday realities. We believe in being able to build more backyards with other modes that can offer you and your friends great places to hang out and &quot;brawl&quot; digitally. To do this well, your wishes and suggestions for improvement are very important to us.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INTERESTED IN THE BEAN \u2013 A KEV x ROCKET BEANS GAME</strong></h2>Backyard Beans is a long-held wish and still in development. We love games and love that people develop games. This project has come to this Early Access version through Kev without financial investment \u2013 he has invested a lot of time, talent, and heart. He has built this game over and over again in between. A long time ago, we had the idea to develop our own &quot;The Beef&quot; game: a cool brawler from the Rocket Beans universe that could ideally convey &quot;the feeling of Beef&quot;. Among many other ideas, castles in the air, and attempts, Backyard Beans came out \u2013 the first step towards game development with talented devs like Kev.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PRAISE IS LIKE A MEDKIT</strong></h2>This is a heartfelt project. Feel free to leave criticism. Please be mindful of your tone, we would like to continue developing Backyard Beans with as much motivation and support as possible. Thank you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1469430/extras/6e8557b904d84fd29f420ac7d647b7bc.avif?t=1724531654\" /></div>",
